{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-06-19 02:30:00', 'title': 'DUPONT SHOWCASES HIGH-PERFORMANCE SOLUTIONS FOR NEXT-GENERATION AEROSPACE TECHNOLOGIES AT 54TH INTERNATIONAL PARIS AIR SHOW', 'text': 'LIGHTWEIGHT AND RELIABLE PRODUCTS FOR MISSION-CRITICAL APPLICATIONS IN AEROSPACE, SPACE EXPLORATION, AND SATELLITES VISIT\xa0DUPONT AT\xa0STAND E64 IN HALL 2B,\xa0 19-25 JUNE 2023, LE BOURGET, FRANCE LE BOURGET, FRANCE , JUNE 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT IS SHOWCASING SOLUTIONS FOR THE AEROSPACE INDUSTRY AT THE 54TH INTERNATIONAL PARIS AIR SHOW, FROM 19 TO 25 JUNE 2023, AT LE BOURGET, JUST OUTSIDE PARIS. THE COMPANY WILL FEATURE A BROAD PORTFOLIO OF AEROSPACE SOLUTIONS, INCLUDING MATERIALS FOR SPACE EXPLORATION AND SATELLITE APPLICATIONS.'}